The legislative texts in this repository are the "Testi coordinati" published by the Consiglio Grande e Generale of
the Republic of San Marino (Segreteria Istituzionale), https://www.consigliograndeegenerale.sm. They are acts of the
State, which Legge 25 gennaio 1991 n.8 (Tutela del diritto d'autore), article 98, letter f), allows anyone to
reproduce, even in full ("la riproduzione, anche integrale, degli atti dello Stato o delle Pubbliche
Amministrazioni o degli atti giudiziari"). The wording is reproduced without change; only the arrangement (one file
per article, one paragraph per line, footnotes in the file that calls them) is Lexifina's.

Lexifina's own contributions (tools, file arrangement, commit messages and documentation) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
